                <pb facs="0261" n="141" sameAs="frus:frus1931v02/pg141"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">822.00/815: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Ecuador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Dawson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Quito</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-10-16T16:00:00-05:00">October 16, 1931—4
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 10:08 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>57. City is quiet and assumption of Executive power by Baquerizo Moreno has been
                    received with satisfaction on all sides.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dawson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
